---
slug: sign-out
method: post
layout: ''
searchable: false
metadata: {
    page_name: "Sign Out - Submit",
}
---

{%- liquid
  comment
    A post without a valid authenticity token arrives with no signed-in user, so another
    site cannot sign anyone out. Clear this session's 2FA pass before signing out.
  endcomment
  if context.current_user
    graphql cleared = 'account/delete_session', name: 'two_factor_user_id'
    graphql signed_out = 'account/sign_out'
  endif
  redirect_to '/sign-out'
-%}
